---
title: "Final Fantasy XIV"
layout: layouts/ffBase.njk
permalink: /shrines/finalfantasyxiv/
description: "My personal Final Fantasy XIV shrine — Aggro Phobic's achievements, little goals, glams, housing plans, screenshots, and Eorzean progress."
---

{% set d = ffxivAchievementDashboard %}

<div class="ff-home">
  <section class="ff-home-hero ff-card">
    <div class="ff-home-portrait-wrap">
      <div class="ff-home-portrait-frame">
        {% if d and d.character and d.character.portrait %}
          <img
            class="ff-home-portrait"
            src="{{ d.character.portrait }}"
            alt="{{ d.character.name }}"
          >
        {% elseif d and d.character and d.character.avatar %}
          <img
            class="ff-home-portrait ff-home-portrait--avatar"
            src="{{ d.character.avatar }}"
            alt="{{ d.character.name }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ff-home-portrait-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <span class="ff-home-fresh-start">fresh start ♡</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-home-hero-copy">
      <p class="ff-home-kicker">✦ adventurer journal ✦</p>

      {% if d and d.character and d.character.title %}
        <p class="ff-home-character-title">{{ d.character.title }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      <h1>{{ d.character.name or "Aggro Phobic" }}</h1>
      <p class="ff-home-world">{{ d.character.worldDisplay or "Lich [Light]" }}</p>

      <p class="ff-home-lede">
        A fresh little life in Eorzea. This is where I’m keeping the things I actually care about:
        progress I’m proud of, achievements I can chase next, pretty glams, housing ideas, gil goals,
        screenshots, and whatever tiny obsession has taken over my brain this week.
      </p>

      <div class="ff-home-actions">
        <a class="ff-button ff-button--primary" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">
          Open achievement journal <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        {% if d and d.character and d.character.lodestoneUrl %}
          <a class="ff-button" href="{{ d.character.lodestoneUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Lodestone <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <a class="ff-button" href="https://eu.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/character/56132424/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Lodestone <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="ff-home-ap-card" aria-label="Achievement snapshot">
      <div class="ff-home-ap-card__top">
        <span>Achievement Points</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
      </div>

      <strong class="ff-home-ap-card__value">{{ d.points.totalDisplay or "—" }}</strong>

      {% if d and d.sourceOk %}
        <div class="ff-home-progress-head">
          <span>Obtainable AP</span>
          <strong>{{ d.points.obtainablePercentDisplay }}</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="ff-home-progress" aria-label="{{ d.points.obtainablePercentDisplay }} of obtainable achievement points earned">
          <span style="width: {{ d.points.obtainablePercent }}%"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="ff-home-ap-mini-grid">
          <div>
            <strong>{{ d.points.earnedCountDisplay }}</strong>
            <span>earned</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>{{ d.nextMilestone.targetDisplay }}</strong>
            <span>next target</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            {% if d.momentum and d.momentum.length > 1 %}
              <strong>{{ d.momentum[1].pointsDisplay }}</strong>
            {% else %}
              <strong>—</strong>
            {% endif %}
            <span>last 30d</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% else %}
        <p class="ff-home-data-note">The live achievement snapshot didn’t refresh this build, but the shrine is still here ♡</p>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-home-now" aria-labelledby="ff-now-title">
    <div class="ff-home-section-heading ff-home-section-heading--outside">
      <div>
        <p class="ff-home-kicker">♡ little nudges</p>
        <h2 id="ff-now-title">Right now in Eorzea</h2>
      </div>
      <p>A tiny automatic snapshot, so the front page always has something useful to say.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-home-now-grid">
      <article class="ff-home-now-card">
        <span class="ff-home-now-card__eyebrow">Next number goal</span>
        <div class="ff-home-now-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</div>
        {% if d and d.sourceOk %}
          <h3>{{ d.points.totalDisplay }} → {{ d.nextMilestone.targetDisplay }}</h3>
          <p><strong>{{ d.nextMilestone.neededDisplay }} points</strong> to the next 250-point milestone.</p>
        {% else %}
          <h3>Keep chipping away</h3>
          <p>The achievement dashboard will fill this back in on the next successful refresh.</p>
        {% endif %}
        <a href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">See the point plan →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-home-now-card ff-home-now-card--pink">
        <span class="ff-home-now-card__eyebrow">Something I could do</span>
        <div class="ff-home-now-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
        {% if d and d.quickWins and d.quickWins.length %}
          <h3>{{ d.quickWins[0].name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ d.quickWins[0].description }}</p>
          <a href="{{ d.quickWins[0].url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            {{ d.quickWins[0].pointsDisplay }} · look it up ↗
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <h3>Pick a little achievement</h3>
          <p>The achievement journal has a whole set of suggestions when the catalogue data is available.</p>
          <a href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">Find a goal →</a>
        {% endif %}
      </article>

      <article class="ff-home-now-card ff-home-now-card--lavender">
        <span class="ff-home-now-card__eyebrow">Latest sparkle</span>
        <div class="ff-home-now-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">★</div>
        {% if d and d.recent and d.recent.length %}
          <h3>{{ d.recent[0].name }}</h3>
          <p>
            {{ d.recent[0].type }}
            {% if d.recent[0].pointsDisplay %} · <strong>{{ d.recent[0].pointsDisplay }}</strong>{% endif %}
          </p>
          <a href="{{ d.recent[0].url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Earned {{ d.recent[0].dateDisplay }} ↗</a>
        {% else %}
          <h3>Recent achievement</h3>
          <p>New unlocks will appear here automatically from the Lodestone history.</p>
          <a href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">Open the journal →</a>
        {% endif %}
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-card ff-home-section">
    <div class="ff-home-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="ff-home-kicker">✦ the crystal archives</p>
        <h2>Explore my Eorzea</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Every little corner of this shrine has a job — tracking, collecting, planning, or just looking pretty.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-home-nav-grid">
      <a class="ff-home-nav-card ff-home-nav-card--featured" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">★</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Progress</span>
        <h3>Achievements</h3>
        <p>Completion, recent unlocks, category progress, next milestones, and things I could work on.</p>
        {% if d and d.sourceOk %}
          <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">{{ d.points.totalDisplay }} AP · {{ d.points.obtainablePercentDisplay }} obtainable</span>
        {% else %}
          <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">open the achievement journal →</span>
        {% endif %}
      </a>

      <a class="ff-home-nav-card" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/checklist/">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Routine</span>
        <h3>Checklist</h3>
        <p>Weeklies, dailies, currencies, grinds, and the things I absolutely will forget otherwise.</p>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">open checklist →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="ff-home-nav-card" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/housing/">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Cosy corner</span>
        <h3>Housing</h3>
        <p>Build ideas, decoration notes, references, and all my inevitable furniture hoarding.</p>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">visit housing →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="ff-home-nav-card" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/glams/">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Dress-up</span>
        <h3>Glams</h3>
        <p>Favourite looks, outfit plans, job aesthetics, and pieces I’m hunting down.</p>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">browse glams →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="ff-home-nav-card" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/gil/">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Little fortune</span>
        <h3>Gil</h3>
        <p>Saving goals, money-making notes, expensive wants, and questionable marketboard decisions.</p>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">count my gil →</span>
      </a>

      <a class="ff-home-nav-card" href="#ffxiv-screenshots">
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__symbol" aria-hidden="true">▣</span>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__label">Memory box</span>
        <h3>Screenshots</h3>
        <p>A little strip of Eorzea I wanted to keep around instead of losing it in the screenshot folder forever.</p>
        <span class="ff-home-nav-card__meta">jump to memories ↓</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ff-home-two-col">
    <section class="ff-card ff-home-about">
      <div class="ff-home-section-heading ff-home-section-heading--compact">
        <div>
          <p class="ff-home-kicker">♡ a new beginning</p>
          <h2>This little life</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        I wanted a clean little corner of Eorzea to make my own again, so this shrine follows this character from here forward:
        new memories, new progress, and whatever ridiculous long-term goals I decide are a good idea.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like FFXIV best when there are lots of different things to bounce between. Sometimes that means actual difficult content;
        sometimes it means spending far too long on a glam, crafting pile, achievement chain, or tiny housing detail.
      </p>
      <p class="ff-home-handwritten">no pressure, just lots of little things to collect ♡</p>
    </section>

    <section class="ff-card ff-home-interests">
      <div class="ff-home-section-heading ff-home-section-heading--compact">
        <div>
          <p class="ff-home-kicker">✦ inevitably distracted by</p>
          <h2>My favourite bits</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ff-home-pills">
        <span>Achievement hunting</span>
        <span>Savage</span>
        <span>Ultimate</span>
        <span>Crafting</span>
        <span>Gathering</span>
        <span>Housing</span>
        <span>Decoration</span>
        <span>Glams</span>
        <span>Gilmaking</span>
        <span>Long-term grinds</span>
        <span>Collecting</span>
        <span>Alt jobs</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  {% if d and d.sourceOk and d.recent and d.recent.length %}
    <section class="ff-card ff-home-section">
      <div class="ff-home-section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="ff-home-kicker">★ recent progress</p>
          <h2>Little victories</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="ff-text-link" href="/shrines/finalfantasyxiv/achievements/">See the full achievement journal →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="ff-home-recent-list">
        {% for achievement in d.recent %}
          {% if loop.index <= 4 %}
            <a class="ff-home-recent-item" href="{{ achievement.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="ff-home-recent-item__spark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
              <span class="ff-home-recent-item__copy">
                <small>{{ achievement.type }}</small>
                <strong>{{ achievement.name }}</strong>
              </span>
              <span class="ff-home-recent-item__meta">
                <b>{{ achievement.pointsDisplay }}</b>
                <time>{{ achievement.dateDisplay }}</time>
              </span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="ff-card ff-home-gallery-section" id="ffxiv-screenshots">
    <div class="ff-home-section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="ff-home-kicker">✦ from Eorzea</p>
        <h2>Screenshot scrapbook</h2>
      </div>
      <p>A few things worth keeping close, even if they’re just ordinary little moments.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-home-gallery">
      <figure class="ff-home-gallery__item ff-home-gallery__item--tall">
        <img src="/assets/imgs/ff/gallery1.png" alt="A Final Fantasy XIV memory" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <figure class="ff-home-gallery__item">
        <img src="/assets/imgs/ff/gallery2.jpg" alt="A Final Fantasy XIV memory" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <figure class="ff-home-gallery__item">
        <img src="/assets/imgs/ff/gallery3.jpg" alt="A Final Fantasy XIV memory" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <figure class="ff-home-gallery__item">
        <img src="/assets/imgs/ff/gallery4.jpg" alt="A Final Fantasy XIV memory" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
      <figure class="ff-home-gallery__item ff-home-gallery__item--wide">
        <img src="/assets/imgs/ff/gallery5.jpg" alt="A Final Fantasy XIV memory" loading="lazy">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ff-home-links-row" aria-label="Useful Final Fantasy XIV links">
    <span>Elsewhere in Eorzea:</span>
    {% if d and d.character and d.character.lodestoneUrl %}
      <a href="{{ d.character.lodestoneUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lodestone ↗</a>
    {% endif %}
    <a href="https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official site ↗</a>
    <a href="https://ffxiv.consolegameswiki.com/wiki/Final_Fantasy_XIV_Wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FFXIV Wiki ↗</a>
    <a href="https://www.ffxiv-gathering.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gathering ↗</a>
  </section>
</div>
